  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'KEEP YOUR HEADLIGHTS ON. TRUST YOUR EYES, NOT EVERY SIGN.


    An ordinary
    overnight shift: collect deliveries, service pumps, repair the breaker, answer
    the CB and restart the generator. Stop beside a marked station and HOLD ACTION
    to complete real work. Tasks unlock the final extraction. The stop changes as
    your shift progresses. Restored power repels the visitor. Complete every task
    to finish the night.


    Movement uses your assigned driving controls. ACTION
    away from a station toggles headlights. Each human keeps an independent truck
    and camera. Cooperative variants share objectives and never award individual
    winner points. Eliminated participants spectate surviving trucks. Rematch restores
    the whole venue, cargo and encounters. Default match: four minutes.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
